package-attributes:
	name: amazon_ssm_agent
	summary: AWS Systems Manager Agent (amazon-ssm-agent) for DeBeOS on Graviton
	description: The real upstream AWS Systems Manager agent (github.com/aws/amazon-ssm-agent, tag v3.3.3270.0, Apache-2.0), cross-compiled for DeBeOS (Haiku) arm64 with the korli/go gc-Go fork plus the DeBeOS haiku/arm64 toolchain patchset. Registers the instance as an EC2-native SSM managed node (i- node) using the instance role over IMDS -- no hybrid activation code -- and executes Run Command and Session Manager. The bundled launch_daemon job starts the agent EC2-native on every boot with a PATH that lets ssm-document-worker resolve the shell. Replaces the interim debeos-ssm-agent as the fleet SSM agent.
